        inAppSupportMessage: `Hi Support Team, regarding Order #${orderOrTicketId}, an unfair penalty of \u20B9${deductionAmount} was deducted from my payout. The delay was entirely caused by adverse weather/traffic conditions beyond rider control. I completed delivery in good faith with customer verification. Kindly review my GPS breadcrumb and reverse this penalty immediately.`,
